      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-600-1/SuggestedAction",
      "description": "A suggested action an organisation can take to manage GAI\nrisks. Each action is identified by an Action ID, linked to an\nAI RMF subcategory, and may be relevant to one or more GAI\nrisks and AI actor tasks (NIST AI 600-1 Section 3).",
      "in_subset": [
